{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ParsedHistoryState"},{"type":"text","value":" type represents a parsed state object. Additionally to "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"HistoryState"},{"type":"text","value":", it contains the index and the unique key of the route."}]},{"type":"code","value":"export type ParsedHistoryState = HistoryState & {\n  key?: string // TODO: Remove in v2 - use __TSR_key instead\n  __TSR_key?: string\n  __TSR_index: number\n}","lang":"tsx"}],"headings":[]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nThe `ParsedHistoryState` type represents a parsed state object. Additionally to `HistoryState`, it contains the index and the unique key of the route.\n\n```tsx\nexport type ParsedHistoryState = HistoryState & {\n  key?: string // TODO: Remove in v2 - use __TSR_key instead\n  __TSR_key?: string\n  __TSR_index: number\n}\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: ParsedHistoryStateType\ntitle: ParsedHistoryState type\n---\n\nThe `ParsedHistoryState` type represents a parsed state object. Additionally to `HistoryState`, it contains the index and the unique key of the route.\n\n```tsx\nexport type ParsedHistoryState = HistoryState & {\n  key?: string // TODO: Remove in v2 - use __TSR_key instead\n  __TSR_key?: string\n  __TSR_index: number\n}\n```\n"}
